  "summary": "I'm a Senior Full Stack Engineer with 15+ years of experience building, modernizing, and scaling web applications.\n\nMy work spans backend development, frontend engineering, cloud infrastructure, and system architecture. I specialize in evolving complex legacy applications into maintainable, modern platforms using Laravel, Node.js, Vue.js, React, and TypeScript.\n\nOver the course of my career, I've designed REST APIs, built data integration and ETL pipelines, implemented cloud-based solutions on AWS, and developed scalable applications that support mission-critical business processes. I enjoy solving complex technical challenges, improving developer workflows, and building systems that are reliable, performant, and easy to maintain.\n\nCore Technologies\n• PHP (Laravel, Nova, Yii), Node.js, MySQL, Redis, Python/Django\n• Vue.js, React, TypeScript, JavaScript (ES6+), Tailwind CSS\n• AWS (ECS, S3, SQS, Glue, CodeDeploy, CloudWatch)\n• REST APIs, ETL Pipelines, CI/CD, GitHub Actions, Jenkins\n• Azure SSO, Microsoft Graph API, Enterprise Integrations",
